# Files that run inside Linux containers, or configure them, keep LF line
# endings even when checked out on Windows. A Windows checkout otherwise turns
# them into CRLF, and a CRLF shell line or config file built into an image fails
# in ways that do not mention line endings (Phase 15).
Dockerfile text eol=lf
.dockerignore text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
.env*.example text eol=lf
